  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Demand driven approach II - PADETC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Demand driven approach II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DDA phase II objectives are:1).To expand access to universal enrolment &amp; improve retention in basic education by adopting the Demand Driven Approach; 2).To strengthen community mobilization &amp; empowerment of women; 3).To improve the quality of learning &amp; teaching in basic education; and 4).To fulfil the EFA expectation by supplying life skills programs for out of school youth, girls first.</narrative>
  </description>
